cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or code, please cite it as below."
title: "RiskPorts: replication data and code for \"Climate Variables and the Costs Generated for the Port Sector: The Case of a Port in Southern Brazil\""
abstract: >-
  Replication package for a study estimating the operational delays and the
  opportunity cost caused by weather-related stoppages at the Sao Francisco do
  Sul port complex, Santa Catarina, Brazil. Contains the analysis dataset of
  4,332 vessel calls between 2018 and 2021, combining port operations records
  with meteorological and wave variables matched to each call, together with the
  R and Stata code that reproduces the tables and figures of the paper.
type: dataset
version: 1.0.2
date-released: "2026-07-29"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/AliFiorentin/RiskPorts"
keywords:
  - port economics
  - climate variability
  - port downtime
  - opportunity cost
  - propensity score matching
  - Brazil
